.\n- The `style` prop dynamically sets the background color of the `TouchableOpacity` based on the `selectExercise` state and the `exercise.id`.\n- The `onPress` prop is set to call the `selectToggle` function with the `exercise.id` when the `TouchableOpacity` is pressed.\n- Inside the `TouchableOpacity`, there's a `Text` component displaying the `exercise.name`. It has some inline styling classes for margin and text size.\n\nIf you have any specific questions or need further explanation, feel free to ask!","turn_id":"turn_000003"},"target_developer_prompt":{"create_time":1713951289.096743,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa28cf8-fcb6-4185-8059-97e579d597a8","source_parent_id":"1e22e01a-db01-420e-a362-4f1ba268140d","source_record_index":2,"text":"{exercise.bodyPart == 'OTHER' && \n            <TouchableOpacity\n              className=''\n              style={{ backgroundColor: selectExercise[exercise.id] ? '#303030' : '#1E1E1E' }}\n              onPress={() => selectToggle(exercise.id)}\n            >\n              <Text className='mx-3 my-[12px] text-[20px] text-slate-200'>{exercise.name}</Text>\n            </TouchableOpacity>\n            }","turn_id":"turn_000002"}},"csv_extraction":{"context":[{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["{exercise.bodyPart == 'OTHER' &&","<TouchableOpacity"],"item_id":"context_1","normalized_text":"A UI fragment conditionally renders a TouchableOpacity when exercise.bodyPart equals 'OTHER'.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]},{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["style={{ backgroundColor: selectExercise[exercise.id] ? '#303030' : '#1E1E1E' }}"],"item_id":"context_2","normalized_text":"The TouchableOpacity background color depends on whether selectExercise[exercise.id] is truthy, using '#303030' when selected and '#1E1E1E' otherwise.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]},{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["onPress={() => selectToggle(exercise.id)}"],"item_id":"c